/*
    Linker File for Renesas FSP (FSP 6.x / DDSC)

    This is a thin wrapper. The device memory map and all section placement are
    generated by the RA Smart Configurator ("Generate Project Content") into:
        - memory_regions.ld : memory region origins/lengths for the selected device
        - fsp_gen.ld        : ENTRY, MEMORY{} and SECTIONS{} (DDSC startup tables)

    Both generated files are emitted into the active build configuration folder
    and are picked up from there at link time. memory_regions.ld must be included
    first because fsp_gen.ld references the symbols it defines (RAM_START, etc.).
*/

INCLUDE memory_regions.ld
INCLUDE fsp_gen.ld
